  "description": "Add AI agents to your .NET application, under your rules. C# methods become tools for an agent built on Microsoft Agent Framework; on each one you declare which roles may use it and whether the user must confirm first. Ready-made chat widget for Blazor and MAUI, or any front end over SignalR and SSE; MCP and A2A with Novior.MentorAgent.Server. Cost control, multi-agent teams, RAG and memory.",
